# Floor tiles, 16×16, seamless. Theme slots F G H (light, base, dark) take each wing's floor colours, so one
# grid gives a tile per theme; tiles with fixed keys only (path, grass, kitchen tile) exist once.
# Light comes from the top-left: highlights on top edges, shadows on bottom and right edges.

